Package: tabellion
Title: Build and Edit Word Documents from Data, R and Typst
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("tabellion contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@example.invalid")
Description: Fills Word templates with tables, figures, captions and
    cross-references that Word treats as its own, edits existing documents as
    tracked changes, and reads tables and text back into R. A Rust engine does
    the work and keeps every untouched part of the document byte-identical.
License: AGPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc >= 1.85
Imports: jsonlite
Config/rextendr/version: 0.4.0
